["er.request/1",{"arguments":{"body":"# execution_recovery indeterminate-effect case passes under machine load\n\n## Outcome\n\n`an_effect_before_failure_and_a_lost_acknowledgement_are_both_indeterminate` (`crates/edge/ess-cli/tests/execution_recovery.rs`) passes on every run at the load a shared build machine sees.\n\n## Why\n\nOn 2026-09-26 it failed once in a full `task check` at load 8-24: the child exit status was `None` where the test expected `Some(1)`. Rerun alone three times it passed 118/118. A flake on main blocks the bot merge queue.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- The mechanism that yields `None` is named and removed, not hidden by a longer timeout.\n- 200 runs under load, 0 failures; the test still fails when the behaviour it guards is broken.\n","document":{"events":[{"args":{"command":"move-status","decided_on":"{\"recorded\":{\"test_result\":1}}","target":"ent-2f83c6ca364c83202cfb0c36e4c56c5b","to":"implemented"},"changed":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":1790410463953,"id":"ent-2f83c6ca364c83202cfb0c36e4c56c5b","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/execution-recovery-indeterminate-case-holds-under-load","provenance":{"created_by":"human:timo","updated_by":"human:timo"},"revision":4,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":1790419120896}},"status":"implemented"},"entity":"aep.entity","from_state":"active","id":"ent-2f83c6ca364c83202cfb0c36e4c56c5b","payload":{"actor":"human:timo","at":1790419120896,"causation":"cmd-child-d8c0344659eef567ae62a6282e59ed9dbccc327efebfdd1325090e71ad6b5ec4","correlation":"protocol-artifact-move","event_id":"aep.entity:ent-2f83c6ca364c83202cfb0c36e4c56c5b@4#0~d0d6bfde46be8ec8","executor":null,"recorded_at":"2026-09-26T10:38:40Z"},"revision":4,"to_state":"implemented","type":"aep.status.move/v1","version":1}],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":1790410463953,"id":"ent-2f83c6ca364c83202cfb0c36e4c56c5b","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/execution-recovery-indeterminate-case-holds-under-load","prov